{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16557","headline":"出三城留别幕中三判官 · 刘复","name":"出三城留别幕中三判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翔禽托高柯，倦客念主人。\n恩义有所知，四海同一身。\n况皆旷大姿，翰音见良辰。\n陈规佐武略，高视据要津。\n常愿投素诚，今果得所申。\n金罍列四座，广厦无氛尘。\n留连徂暑中，观望历数旬。\n河山险以固，士卒勇且仁。\n饬装去未归，相追越城闉。\n愧无青玉案，缄佩永不泯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16557.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16557","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}